<title>SWITZERLAND: ALSO 96 group profit falls,steady dividend.</title>
<headline>ALSO 96 group profit falls,steady dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HERGISWIL, Switzerland 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     3.8		 vs 9.2</p>
<p> Group sales		    577		 vs 438</p>
<p> Holding net profit	   10.4		vs 7.1</p>
<p> Div (regd, Sfr)		3.00		vs 3.00</p>
<p>NOTE - ALSO, a subsidiary of Schindler Holding AG, said in a statement that the outlook for 1997 and beyond was intact and should allow the company to return to earlier profitability levels.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom 41-1-258 7340</p>
</text>
